                    {c.farmShare2024 - c.farmShare2023 >= 0 ? "+" : ""}
                    {(c.farmShare2024 - c.farmShare2023).toFixed(1)}??). Marketing
                    bill {c.marketingShare2024}??. Spending ??? $
                    {c.spending2024Bn >= 1000
                      ? `${(c.spending2024Bn / 1000).toFixed(2)}T`
